// E2E fixture: self-registering worker used by the ChildSupervisor
// config-preserving-restart regression test (BT-3366). Registering under a
// fixed name on every `initialize` (including after a crash-triggered
// restart, since the dead process's name is auto-released) gives the test
// a stable way to reach "whichever instance is currently alive" across the
// restart, without needing a `which:`-style introspection method on
// ChildSupervisor (which, like DynamicSupervisor, intentionally has none —
// see ChildSupervisor.bt). `value` is set via spawnWith: #{#value => N}.

Actor subclass: E2EChildSupNamedWorker
  state: value = 0

  class supervisionPolicy -> Symbol => #permanent

  initialize => self registerAs: #e2eChildSupRestartWorker

  getValue => self.value
